{"ref":"character:luminaire-foscari","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Keitha_Muort.gif","w":40,"h":38}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Tides of the Foscari)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Luminaire Foscari is a playable character from the Tides of the Foscari DLC of Vampire Survivors. Her starting weapon is the ",{"i":"Sprite-Prismatic_Missile.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:prismatic-missile"}," ",{"t":"Prismatic Missile","r":"weapon:prismatic-missile"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["13 April 2023 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Luminaire"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["LUMINAIRE"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["CharacterControllerLuminaire"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Prismatic_Missile.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:prismatic-missile"}," ",{"t":"Prismatic Missile","r":"weapon:prismatic-missile"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["With ",{"t":"Maruto","r":"character:maruto-cuts"},", break the Seal of the Abyss."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 5,000"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-The_Heart_of_the_World.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"The Heart of the World\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Recovery","cells":[["0.50"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+40%"]]},{"label":"Revival","cells":[["+7"]]},{"label":"Banish","cells":[["+5"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Luminaire can be unlocked by breaking the Seal of the Abyss in ",{"t":"Abyss Foscari","r":"stage:abyss-foscari"}," with ",{"i":"Sprite-Legionnaire.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:legionnaire"}," ",{"t":"Legionnaire","r":"weapon:legionnaire"}," while playing as ",{"i":"Sprite-Maruto_Cuts.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:maruto-cuts"}," ",{"t":"Maruto Cuts","r":"character:maruto-cuts"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["After unlocking, Luminaire Foscari can be purchased for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 5,000, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Luminaire Foscari can be unlocked in the",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"deusexmachina\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Luminaire Foscari starts with +0.5 ",{"i":"Sprite-Recovery.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:recovery"}," ",{"t":"Recovery","r":"powerup:recovery"},", +40% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},", +7 ",{"i":"Sprite-Revival.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:revival"}," ",{"t":"Revival","r":"powerup:revival"},", and +5 ",{"i":"Sprite-Banish.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:banish"}," ",{"t":"Banish","r":"powerup:banish"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Upon leveling up, Luminaire triggers a ",{"i":"Sprite-Rosary.png","w":24,"h":24}," Rosary. After reviving, she gets a temporary +200% ",{"i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"},", -100% ",{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"},", and +60% (up to 300%) ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"}," (to prevent her from moving too fast) bonus. This bonus lasts for (15+2*times revived) seconds, which means it starts at 17 seconds of bonus, then +2 seconds per Revival used. She also gets a longer invincibility frame each time she revives, based on the formula: (4+2*times revived) seconds."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["With her extra Revivals, ",{"i":"Sprite-Phieraggi.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:phieraggi"}," ",{"t":"Phieraggi","r":"weapon:phieraggi"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Meal_Ticket.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"weapon:meal-ticket"}," ",{"t":"Meal Ticket","r":"weapon:meal-ticket"}," can be considered her best weapons."]},{"c":[{"t":"Awake (IV)","r":"arcana:awake-iv"}," is a very strong Arcana on her due to her massive amount of revives. If things go poorly, over the course of many revives, Luminaire can grow into a formidable force, even with her mediocre base stats."]},{"c":[{"t":"Wicked Season (XIII)","r":"arcana:wicked-season-xiii"}," helps scale Luminaire's ",{"i":"Sprite-Growth.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:growth"}," ",{"t":"Growth","r":"powerup:growth"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Curse.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:curse"}," ",{"t":"Curse","r":"powerup:curse"}," throughout the game, letting her level up more often and trigger more Rosaries. This means that other items that increase Growth, Curse and Charm (",{"i":"Sprite-Crown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:crown"}," ",{"t":"Crown","r":"passive:crown"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Skull_O'Maniac.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:skull-o-maniac"}," ",{"t":"Skull O'Maniac","r":"passive:skull-o-maniac"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Torrona's_Box.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:torrona-s-box"}," ",{"t":"Torrona's Box","r":"passive:torrona-s-box"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Karoma's_Mana.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:karoma-s-mana"}," ",{"t":"Karoma's Mana","r":"passive:karoma-s-mana"},") can all be useful."]},{"c":["Luminaire can have at least 13 revives and a few more (+7 base, +1 from shop, +2 from ",{"i":"Sprite-Tirajisú.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:tirajisu"}," ",{"t":"Tirajisú","r":"passive:tirajisu"},", +3 from ",{"t":"Awake (IV)","r":"arcana:awake-iv"},"; +2 if ",{"i":"Sprite-Academy_Badge.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:academy-badge"}," ",{"t":"Academy Badge","r":"passive:academy-badge"}," is available, and +1 per ",{"i":"Sprite-Weapon_Power-Up.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:weapon-power-up"}," ",{"t":"Weapon Power-Up","r":"passive:weapon-power-up"}," if it is available, which can make it beneficial to pick up some Operation Guns weapons like ",{"i":"Sprite-C-U-Laser.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:c-u-laser"}," ",{"t":"C-U-Laser","r":"weapon:c-u-laser"},"/",{"i":"Sprite-Pronto_Beam.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:pronto-beam"}," ",{"t":"Pronto Beam","r":"weapon:pronto-beam"},")."]},{"c":["Despite her high movement speed, it is generally not recommended for Luminaire to move around the map a lot. This is because Luminaire wants to level up at a steady rate instead of letting XP gems gather into a single super-gem that would trigger multiple level-ups and thus Rosaries when that may not be necessary. ",{"i":"Sprite-Attractorb.png","w":18,"h":18,"r":"passive:attractorb"}," ",{"t":"Attractorb","r":"passive:attractorb"}," is highly recommended. ",{"i":"Sprite-Gorgeous_Moon.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:gorgeous-moon"}," ",{"t":"Gorgeous Moon","r":"weapon:gorgeous-moon"}," can gather XP gems to Luminaire, but triggering a Rosary immediately after Gorgeous Moon's screen-clearing effect may be overkill."]},{"c":["Luminaire can very easily run a Reaper-killing build, as her Rosary effect helps offset the early disadvantages of ",{"i":"Sprite-Laurel.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:laurel"}," ",{"t":"Laurel","r":"weapon:laurel"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Clock_Lancet.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:clock-lancet"}," ",{"t":"Clock Lancet","r":"weapon:clock-lancet"}," before they are evolved."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Vicious_Hunger.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:vicious-hunger"}," ",{"t":"Vicious Hunger","r":"weapon:vicious-hunger"}," is not recommended, as it greatly affects leveling rate and prevents Luminaire from triggering Rosaries as often."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Seraphic_Cry.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:seraphic-cry"}," ",{"t":"Seraphic Cry","r":"weapon:seraphic-cry"}," does not replace the rosary effect triggered by Luminaire leveling up with a soul purifier."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"gallery-sprites","title":"Sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Luminaire_Foscari.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Luminaire Foscari's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Luminaire_Foscari.gif","w":105,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}]},{"id":"gallery-other","title":"Other","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Luminaire_Foscari_-_trailer.png","w":280,"h":225,"c":["Luminaire Foscari as seen in the ",{"t":"launch trailer","x":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iC4O-_kG11s"}," of Tides of the Foscari."]}]}]}]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["beta ",{"i":"Steam_logo.svg","w":16,"h":16,"a":"Steam"}," 4 June 2026 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fixed Luminaire's level up VFX"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 13 April 2023 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["The description of the expansion mentions her having a title \"the Lady of the Lake\" which is a reference to ",{"t":"the eponymous characters","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lady_of_the_Lake"}," of Arthurian legend."]},{"c":["The spell used to unlock Luminaire references the literary trope ",{"t":"deus ex machina","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deus_ex_machina"},", a sudden resolution to a seemingly impossible to resolve conflict, often due to the intervention of an unexpected character or an improbable event occuring."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Luminaire becomes an example of this trope during the boss battle against ",{"i":"Sprite-Je-Ne-Viv.png","w":24,"h":24}," Je-Ne-Viv in ",{"t":"Abyss Foscari","r":"stage:abyss-foscari"},", with the sudden appearance of ",{"i":"Sprite-Prismatic_Missile.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:prismatic-missile"}," ",{"t":"Prismatic Missile","r":"weapon:prismatic-missile"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Crown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:crown"}," ",{"t":"Crown","r":"passive:crown"}," leading her to appear after they're evolved into ",{"i":"Sprite-Luminaire.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:luminaire"}," ",{"t":"Luminaire","r":"weapon:luminaire"},", which quickly leads to the defeat of the seemingly undefeatable Je-Ne-Viv."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]}]}